// A ~1,000-line program, checked in so the compile-time row is stable.
//
// Each function is one item for the lexer, parser, checker and backend;
// main calls every one so nothing can be dropped as unused. The result is
// printed and checked, so a wrong program is a failed run, not a fast one.
